  "notes": [
    "CInt/CLng round half to even: CInt(2.5)=2, CInt(3.5)=4, CLng(-2.5)=-2.",
    "Integer division rounds operands to even first, then truncates toward zero: 7.5\\2 -> 8\\2 = 4; -7\\2 = -3 (unary minus binds first).",
    "Mod rounds operands to even, sign follows the dividend: 5.5 Mod 2 -> 6 Mod 2 = 0; -7 Mod 3 = -1.",
    "Round without digits is banker's rounding: Round(2.5)=2, Round(3.5)=4.",
    "Int floors (-3), Fix truncates (-2).",
    "i is Integer and 1 is an Integer literal, so i + 1 is evaluated in Integer and overflows with error 6 before the assignment; under On Error Resume Next the statement is skipped and i stays 32767.",
